# Name: Repository ignore rules
# Purpose: Keeps generated, local, and secret files out of version control.
# Usage: Applied automatically by Git for this working tree.
# Validation: git status --ignored
# References: AGENTS.md Section 2B, docs/troubleshooting/README.md

